The '''Oasis Sheep''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that spawns while fishing in the {{Zone|Oasis}} after unlocking {{Skill|Fishing|X}}. They act like normal [[Sheep]], and deal no damage to the player.

Bringing one to [[Jake]] will allow the player to purchase the [[Hardened Wood]].

== Spawning ==
An '''Oasis Sheep''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Oasis}} with a water [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] if the player has {{Skill|fishing|10}}.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Oasis Sheep''' is {{Green|700}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|13.22%|1|7.57|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there's no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

